grounding.quote:
A profile may bind a core mechanism to one of these;
the binding is declared in the profile with its direction, preserved
meaning, narrowed scope and invalidation.

- the preserved meaning, changed meaning, loss and refusal conditions;
- the source and target semantic owners, without transferring either
  authority;
- the selected source and target bases, the governed scope and
  provenance; and
- its lifecycle and invalidation conditions.

one closed model-family signature under an exact a_c basis without
  changing the calculus or selecting a consumer, and whose adoption stays
  optional;

the compressed read models under `authority_compressions/` are restated as
a member kind only, their carrier staying unresolved at the compression
rows pending the product owner's ruling;
